# Every ignored CVE here MUST have a linked justification — an empty/unexplained
# .trivyignore is itself a security review finding.
#
# Example format (kept empty in this template — add real entries only with a
# documented compensating control and a review-by date):
# CVE-2024-XXXXX  # justification: not reachable, package used in test-only path. Review: 2026-12-01
